# Superpowers plans, specs, and research notes are local-only — never commit them.
# Specs: .docs/specs/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md
# Plans: .docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md
# Research: .docs/research/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md
